Body:
still broken on 1.18.14. 
Denies to edit/write in projects directory with this config:
```
"permission": {
  "edit": {
    "*": "deny",  
    "/Users/enduro/stuff/Neuro/projects/**": "allow"
}
```

The updated replacement PR #40857 is ready for review after #34256 was closed by automated cleanup.

It is rebased onto current `dev`, keeps `@romanilyin/canonicalpath`, covers both v1 workspace routing and v2 location lookup, and preserves relative Windows hints while rejecting foreign rooted syntax before lookup. Focused server tests pass 57/57 and workspace typecheck passes 30/30 Turbo tasks.

@Hona, could you please take a look when you have a chance?

Temporary solution

```jsonc
// ~/.config/opencode/opencode.jsonc
{
  "provider": {
    "cf-ai-gateway": {
      "npm": "@ai-sdk/openai-compatible",
      "name": "CF AI Gateway",
      "options": {
        "baseURL": "https://gateway.ai.cloudflare.com/v1/<user id>/<gateway name>/compat"
      },
      "models": {
        "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash": {
          "limit": {
            "context": 1000000,
            "output": 384000
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```
```jsonc
// ~/.local/share/opencode/auth.json
{
  "cf-ai-gateway": {
    "type": "api",
    "key": "<API Key>"
  }
}
```
